cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Agent Security Labs"
type: software
version: "0.0.1"
abstract: >-
  Agent Security Labs is an offline, deterministic, mediated-agent security
  laboratory for learning AI-agent security by reading traces. Eight educational
  labs (LAB-00 through LAB-07) run a scripted model fixture against in-memory
  tools through a single mediated tool gateway, and write a JSONL trace in which
  the request, the policy decision, the execution and the result are separate,
  causally linked events. It is educational and reproducibility infrastructure:
  it is not a benchmark, and it makes no research claim.
authors:
